8.38}, {"w": " de", "s": 38.38, "e": 38.68}, {"w": " 8", "s": 38.68, "e": 39.06}, {"w": " sur", "s": 39.06, "e": 39.5}, {"w": " 10.", "s": 39.5, "e": 39.98}]}, {"start": 40.06, "end": 42.18, "text": " Avant de passer au dessert, on enchaîne avec Anto,", "words": [{"w": " Avant", "s": 40.06, "e": 40.2}, {"w": " de", "s": 40.2, "e": 40.36}, {"w": " passer", "s": 40.36, "e": 40.6}, {"w": " au", "s": 40.6, "e": 40.76}, {"w": " dessert,", "s": 40.76, "e": 41.06}, {"w": " on", "s": 41.2, "e": 41.34}, {"w": " enchaîne", "s": 41.34, "e": 41.52}, {"w": " avec", "s": 41.52, "e": 41.84}, {"w": " Anto,", "s": 41.84, "e": 42.18}]}, {"start": 42.26, "end": 45.0, "text": " mon amie d'enfance depuis un an, accompagnée de Julie, la timide.", "words": [{"w": " mon", "s": 42.26, "e": 42.36}, {"w": " amie", "s": 42.36, "e": 42.5}, {"w": " d", "s": 42.5, "e": 42.56}, {"w": "'enfance", "s": 42.56, "e": 42.84}, {"w": " depuis", "s": 42.84, "e": 43.14}, {"w": " un", "s": 43.14, "e": 43.34}, {"w": " an,", "s": 43.34, "e": 43.48}, {"w": " accompagnée", "s": 43.66, "e": 43.9}, {"w": " de", "s": 43.9, "e": 44.08}, {"w": " Julie,", "s": 44.08, "e": 44.4}, {"w": " la", "s": 44.5, "e": 44.72}, {"w": " timide.", "s": 44.72, "e": 45.0}]}, {"start": 45.08, "end": 45.36, "text": " Vas-y !", "words": [{"w": " Vas", "s": 45.08, "e": 45.2}, {"w": "-y", "s": 45.2, "e": 45.26}, {"w": " !", "s": 45.26, "e": 45.36}]}, {"start": 45.36, "end": 47.2, "text": " On a pris en entrée des aubergines.", "words": [{"w": " On", "s": 45.36, "e": 45.52}, {"w": " a", "s": 45.52, "e": 45.76}, {"w": " pris", "s": 45.76, "e": 45.98}, {"w": " en", "s": 45.98, "e": 46.22}, {"w": " entrée", "s": 46.22, "e": 46.64}, {"w": " des", "s": 46.64, "e": 46.8}, {"w": " aubergines.", "s": 46.8, "e": 47.2}]}, {"start": 47.52, "end": 49.02, "text": " Incroyable, franchement elles étaient moelleuses,", "words": [{"w": " Incroyable,", "s": 47.52, "e": 47.88}, {"w": " franchement", "s": 47.96, "e": 48.24}, {"w": " elles", "s": 48.24, "e": 48.36}, {"w": " étaient", "s": 48.36, "e": 48.6}, {"w": " moelleuses,", "s": 48.6, "e": 49.02}]}, {"start": 49.02, "end": 50.34, "text": " j'ai jamais mangé des aubergines aussi bonnes.", "words": [{"w": " j", "s": 49.02, "e": 49.12}, {"w": "'ai", "s": 49.12, "e": 49.18}, {"w": " jamais", "s": 49.18, "e": 49.4}, {"w": " mangé", "s": 49.4, "e": 49.72}, {"w": " des", "s": 49.72, "e": 49.84}, {"w": " aubergines", "s": 49.84, "e": 50.1}, {"w": " aussi", "s": 50.1, "e": 50.28}, {"w": " bonnes.", "s": 50.28, "e": 50.34}]}, {"start": 50.4, "end": 53.14, "text": " Et on plat des nouilles biaang biaang qui font 2 mètres.", "words": [{"w": " Et", "s": 50.4, "e": 50.58}, {"w": " on", "s": 50.58, "e": 50.84}, {"w": " plat", "s": 50.84, "e": 50.94}, {"w": " des", "s": 50.94, "e": 51.3}, {"w": " nouilles", "s": 51.3, "e": 51.66}, {"w": " biaang", "s": 51.66, "e": 52.0}, {"w": " biaang", "s": 52.0, "e": 52.26}, {"w": " qui", "s": 52.26, "e": 52.4}, {"w": " font", "s": 52.4, "e": 52.56}, {"w": " 2", "s": 52.56, "e": 52.82}, {"w": " mètres.", "s": 52.82, "e": 53.14}]}, {"start": 53.16, "end": 56.24, "text": " Et surtout avec la nouveauté, du coup c'est la Côte de Beuf,", "words": [{"w": " Et", "s": 53.16, "e": 53.44}, {"w": " surtout", "s": 53.44, "e": 53.74}, {"w": " avec", "s": 53.74, "e": 54.14}, {"w": " la", "s": 54.14, "e": 54.44}, {"w": " nouveauté,", "s": 54.44, "e": 54.84}, {"w": " du", "s": 54.94, "e": 55.04}, {"w": " coup", "s": 55.04, "e": 55.16}, {"w": " c", "s": 55.16, "e": 55.34}, {"w": "'est", "s": 55.34, "e": 55.48}, {"w": " la", "s": 55.48, "e": 55.7}, {"w": " Côte", "s": 55.7, "e": 55.82}, {"w": " de", "s": 55.82, "e": 56.0}, {"w": " Beuf,", "s": 56.0, "e": 56.24}]}, {"start": 56.3, "end": 58.12, "text": " puis pendant 8 heures, c'était excellent.", "words": [{"w": " puis", "s": 56.3, "e": 56.46}, {"w": " pendant", "s": 56.46, "e": 56.76}, {"w": " 8", "s": 56.76, "e": 57.0}, {"w": " heures,", "s": 57.0, "e": 57.28}, {"w": " c", "s": 57.34, "e": 57.58}, {"w": "'était"